"Costumes dress this device in generic shapes; its own addresses stay its own. Nothing here copies a real device's identity, clones an advertisement the ear has heard, or plants a fake tracker — a wardrobe, not a forgery kit." = "Les costumes habillent cet appareil de formes génériques ; ses propres adresses restent les siennes. Rien ici ne copie un appareil réel.";
