"The Watch is never asked to do anything — worn and paired, it already measures, and the readings wait in this phone's health store. A reading, not a live feed: samples arrive at the Watch's sync cadence, and every value carries its age. Read-only and on-device; raw readings are never written to the night log." = "On ne demande jamais rien à la Watch — portée et appairée, elle mesure déjà, et les relevés attendent dans HealthKit.";
